    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Demelia's Isle</strong> is a <strong>RPG</strong> <strong>third person</strong> in an <strong>Open World</strong>. <strong>Explore</strong>, <strong>Fight</strong> improve your equipment to defeat demonic forces that are once again awakening in this isolated realm.<br>Your adventure will take you to the most remote places of this open world, the island of Demelia, where many dungeons and demonic creatures await you.<br>It's up to you to assess whether you prefer to attack head-on or be as discreet as possible. Avoid deadly traps set for you, and scour dungeons in search of secrets.<br>The world of Demelia will evolve as you progress and the night will bring new dangers and quests.<br><br><strong>CHARACTERISTICS: </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Be as you like: </strong> Customize your character's appearance as you see fit.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The world is changing: </strong> Your progress in the main and side quests will change the elements of the world and unlock new things, such as access to new dungeons and better weapons.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Be curious: </strong> Explore the island and discover all the hidden treasures and dungeons, the more curious you are, the more rewarded you will be.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Day/night cycle: </strong> At night new and more dangerous creatures will appear, be ready to face them as some quests must be done at night.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> Survive together: </strong> You can play co-op with up 2 of your friends.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Demelia's Isle</strong> is a <strong>RPG</strong> <strong>third person</strong> in an <strong>Open World</strong>. <strong>Explore</strong>, <strong>Fight</strong> improve your equipment to defeat demonic forces that are once again awakening in this isolated realm.<br>Your adventure will take you to the most remote places of this open world, the island of Demelia, where many dungeons and demonic creatures await you.<br>It's up to you to assess whether you prefer to attack head-on or be as discreet as possible. Avoid deadly traps set for you, and scour dungeons in search of secrets.<br>The world of Demelia will evolve as you progress and the night will bring new dangers and quests.<br><br><strong>CHARACTERISTICS: </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Be as you like: </strong> Customize your character's appearance as you see fit.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The world is changing: </strong> Your progress in the main and side quests will change the elements of the world and unlock new things, such as access to new dungeons and better weapons.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Be curious: </strong> Explore the island and discover all the hidden treasures and dungeons, the more curious you are, the more rewarded you will be.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Day/night cycle: </strong> At night new and more dangerous creatures will appear, be ready to face them as some quests must be done at night.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> Survive together: </strong> You can play co-op with up 2 of your friends.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You just woke up on a beach. Simply trying to survive, you find yourself immersed in a quest against the demonic forces that are awakening again in this isolated kingdom.",
